{
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.AfterLookingAroundThe": "[pg]After looking around the room for a while, you look into the mirror and begin to recollect who you are..."
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.EverythingFadesWhiteAnd": "Everything fades to white and finally... black. You can feel yourself being whisked back to reality as you slowly awaken in your room. You survey your surroundings and recognize almost immediately; you are in your room inside the inn in Ingnam! You get up and look around."
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.It'sEmptyAndYou": "It's empty and you let out a sigh but you know you can bring it to Mareth."
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.It'sEmptyAndYouLet": "It's empty and you let out a sigh but you know you can bring it to Mareth."
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.It'sEmptyAndYouLetOut": "It's empty and you let out a sigh but you know you can bring it to Mareth."
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.It'sEmptyAndYouLetOutDisappointed": "It's empty and you let out a disappointed sigh."
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.It'sEmptyAndYouLetOutSigh": "It's empty and you let out a sigh but you know you can bring it to Mareth."
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.It'sMakingSenseThe": "It's making sense! The contents must be from your past adventures."
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.SomethingClicksYourMind": "Something clicks in your mind; they must be the old shields you had from your previous incarnation!"
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.SomethingClicksYourMindThey": "Something clicks in your mind; they must be the old stuff you had from your previous incarnation"
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.SomethingClicksYourMindTheyMust": "Something clicks in your mind; they must be the old weapons you had from your previous incarnation!"
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.SomethingClicksYourMindTheyMustThe": "Something clicks in your mind; they must be the old armors you had from your previous incarnation!"
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.ThereArmorRackYou": "[pg]There is an armor rack. You look at it. "
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.ThereJewelryBoxThe": "[pg]There is a jewelry box on the dresser. You walk over to the box, open it, and look inside. "
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.ThereShieldRackYou": "[pg]There is a shield rack. You look at it. "
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.ThereWeaponRackYou": "[pg]There is a weapon rack. You look at it. "
  "CharCreation.Reincarnate.YouTakeGlanceThe": "[pg]You take a glance at the chest; you don't remember having it inside your room. You open the chest and look inside. "
}
